


<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <style type="text/css">
        .error {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding: 100px 20px 20px;
            height: auto;
            background: url(/images/frt/common/error.gif) center 20px no-repeat;
            background-size: 100px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .error p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6em;
            margin: 0px 0 2px 0%
        }

        .error dd {
            margin-left: -20px;
        }

        .error .tit {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #333;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .error .go {
            padding-top: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .error .go a {
            color: #0073dc;
        }

        #contents #error_wrap h1 img {
            display: none;
        }

        br.mobile {
            display: block;
        }

        @media all and (min-width: 768px) {
            #error_wrap {
                width: 70%;
                max-width: 880px;
                left: 50%;
                top: 50%;
                position: absolute;
                margin-left: -25%;
                margin-top: -220px;
            }

            #error_wrap h1 {
                margin-bottom: 5px;
            }

            #contents #error_wrap {
                width: 100%;
                left: auto;
                top: auto;
                position: relative;
                margin: 80px auto;
            }

            .error {
                padding: 50px 30px;
                background-position: 60px;
                background-size: auto;
                text-align: left;
            }

            .error p {
                margin: 0 0 2px 35%;
            }

            .error .tit {
                font-size: 26px;
            }

            br.mobile {
                display: none;
            }
        }

        @media all and (min-width: 1200px) {
            #error_wrap {
                width: 60%;
            }

            .error {
                background-position: 100px 60px;
                padding: 50px 30px 50px 100px;
            }

            .error p {
                margin: 0 0 2px 28%;
            }
        }
    </style>

    <script type="text/javascript">
        function fncGoAfterErrorPage() {
            history.back(-2);
        }
    </script>
</head>

<body>
<div id="error_wrap">
    <h1><img src="/images/com/img_logo.png" alt="행정안전부"/></h1>
    <div class="error">
        <p class="tit">요청하신 페이지가 없습니다.</p>
        <p>죄송합니다.<br/>
            요청하신 페이지의 경로가 잘못되었거나 존재하지 않는 페이지입니다.<br/>
        </p>
        <p class="go"><a href="https://www.mois.go.kr">행정안전부 홈페이지 메인으로 바로가기 ▶▶</a></p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
